    "No visual acceptance or claim stationary/subpixel silhouette shimmer is resolved. Original Claude0072 rejection remains historical evidence.",
    "Ignored GPU fixtures and composed overlay-depth occlusion still require real execution and Claude pixel review; shader/CPU reasoning is not that evidence.",
    "MetalFX/cooked temporal integration, exact depth/copy artifacts, target ABI validation and explicit recook remain separate root-owned work.",
    "No device, performance, complete-frame GPU-cost, release or phase-gate approval."
